unit-less, sequential: the width-3 call averages over its own width: true
unit-less, sequential: the width-5 call averages over its own width: true
unit-less, built together: the width-3 call averages over its own width: true
unit-less, built together: the width-5 call averages over its own width: true
unit-parameter instance: the width-3 call averages over its own width: true
unit-parameter instance: the width-5 call averages over its own width: true
unit-parameter instance: both calls use the instance's one parameter: true
batch_norm1d: the batch-2 call normalizes with its own batch size: true
batch_norm1d: the batch-4 call normalizes with its own batch size: true
